      "content": "it's just that rest doesnt seem to work anymore. even when i sleep i'm still just... that person who doesn't belong. i look at people living their lives and i just feel like i'm watching a movie in a language i'll never speak. sometimes i think the only way to actually get some quiet is to just... stop. like, truly stop the noise.",
